{"id":"n55423-1-9","stage":3,"title":"멜로디 · 旋律","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55423-1-9-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 흥얼거리니?","zh":"你在那儿哼什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"흥얼거리니?","meaning":"哼唱，哼哼","explanation":"흥얼거리다：哼唱，哼哼；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"흥얼거리다","audio":"/audio/d4731f4f4e5bee6429f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89525","senseId":"1","lemma":"흥얼거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흥얼거리니","audio":"/audio/84fa4de97700c4a9693f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d4731f4f4e5bee64","term":"흥얼거리다","zh":"哼唱，哼哼","audio":"/audio/d4731f4f4e5bee6429f5.mp3","entryId":"89525","definition":"因兴致高或心情好而嘴里一直唱歌。","pronunciation":["흥얼거리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/247b2d87e981496443d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55423-1-9-2","ko":"멜로디가 무척 좋아서 나도 모르게 흥얼거렸나 봐.","zh":"因为旋律太好听了，所以不知不觉就跟着哼起来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"멜로디가","meaning":"旋律","explanation":"멜로디：旋律；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멜로디","audio":